  "cards": [
    {
      "dot": "service",
      "title": "From desired state to synchronization",
      "items": [
        "The engine commits declaration changes and change records together. The notifier reads those records after commit and obtains current synchronization tokens.",
        "The notifier queues DeclarativeManagement with TokensResponse in Data and deduplicates by declaration-token generation. A configured pusher requests an MDM wake."
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "policy",
      "title": "Delivery eligibility and activation",
      "items": [
        "The reference composition evaluates declaration support against enrollment inventory before advertisement and refreshes snapshots when eligibility changes.",
        "Automatic status subscriptions include an activation unless an administrator overrides the generated identifiers. The device evaluates activation predicates and reports status; server publication does not prove activation."
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "service",
      "title": "Timing and cleanup",
      "items": [
        "Defaults coalesce recent changes for two seconds and poll each second; admin mutations also wake the notifier. These timings are repository policy.",
        "Initial or changed-identity Authenticate and CheckOut clear declarative state. Same-certificate retries and controlled profile replacement retain the working enrollment’s state."
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "transport",
      "title": "Public documentation",
      "items": [
        "Integrating declarative management — https://developer.apple.com/documentation/devicemanagement/integrating-declarative-management",
        "Declarations — https://developer.apple.com/documentation/devicemanagement/devicemanagement-declarations",
        "RFC 8785 — JSON Canonicalization Scheme — https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc8785",
        "Declarative data model and activation — https://developer.apple.com/documentation/devicemanagement/leveraging-the-declarative-management-data-model-to-scale-devices"
      ]
    }
  ]
